atlas:
Use case: stylized-concept
Asset type: a production sprite atlas for Lanternfall, an original mobile fantasy roguelike.
Primary request: exactly one square 1024 x 1024 raster image, a perfectly aligned 4 by 4 sprite atlas. Every cell is exactly 256 x 256 pixels, with its one sprite centered at the exact cell center and completely contained within the central 75 percent of its cell. The background must have actual transparency / alpha, not a checkerboard illustration. No ground squares, no scene, no grid lines, no numbers, no letters, no text.
Style/medium: premium charming dark-edge JRPG painterly pixel game art. Top-down three-quarter sprites for a tile-based game. Crisp pixel edges, exquisite small readable details, consistent lighting, clean distinct silhouettes, original designs with no franchise copying.
Exact row-major content; 16 separate cells, one sprite per cell, no additional sprites:
